00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.100
What did you call me here for? To show off? To flaunt your victory in my face?

2
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:13.080
You're so proud of yourself, aren't you Evelyn?

3
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.580
You won!

4
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:21.240
That bastard Vincent is head over heels for you. Arthur's been tricked by you.

5
00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.680
And he even fired my people because of you!

6
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:27.460
Win?

7
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.460
No, Sophia. You're mistaken.

8
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.860
You are never my enemy.

9
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.860
I'm the mistress of this house and you?

10
00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.860
You're just a replaceable servant.

11
00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:40.360
No different, not mad dog that bit people this morning.

12
00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.560
What did you say?

13
00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:45.880
Don't you realize how ridiculous you are? You have a crush on Arthur, you grovel to Vincent.

14
00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:50.840
You're just delusional thinking you can one day climb into the master's bed. Too bad after Isabretta died

15
00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:55.140
It's me standing here. Even if I die a lowly servant like you will never take my place.

16
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.500
Bitch! I knew it!

17
00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:03.810
This of yours is all an act! You're just a whore!

18
00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:07.530
So what if I am?

19
00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:09.330
Then let's see.

20
00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:13.610
If you fall from here and die, we'll find out who this house really belongs to!

21
00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:18.490
Thank you for your help.
